<section class="surfdoc-section">
<h1 id="video">Video</h1>
<p>The video element (0.37.0): a player with a poster, a caption and playback
flags; a hero with a background video; an embed that names a video file; and
library references (<code>media:</code>) that draw the placeholder until a host
resolves them.</p>

<figure class="surfdoc-video"><video class="surfdoc-video-player" controls playsinline preload="none" poster="/img/intro.jpg" aria-label="A phone showing the claim screen" style="aspect-ratio:16 / 9"><source src="/media/intro.mp4" type="video/mp4"></video><figcaption class="surfdoc-video-cap">How a claim works</figcaption></figure>
<figure class="surfdoc-video surfdoc-video-autoplay" style="max-width:640px"><video class="surfdoc-video-player surfdoc-video-motion" autoplay muted loop playsinline preload="metadata" poster="/img/loop.jpg" aria-label="Waves rolling in"><source src="https://cdn.example.com/loop.webm" type="video/webm" media="(prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference)"></video><video class="surfdoc-video-player surfdoc-video-still" controls muted loop playsinline preload="none" poster="/img/loop.jpg" aria-label="Waves rolling in"><source src="https://cdn.example.com/loop.webm" type="video/webm"></video></figure>
<figure class="surfdoc-video surfdoc-video-autoplay"><video class="surfdoc-video-player surfdoc-video-motion" controls autoplay muted playsinline preload="metadata" style="aspect-ratio:9 / 16"><source src="/media/clip.mov" type="video/quicktime" media="(prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference)"></video><video class="surfdoc-video-player surfdoc-video-still" controls muted playsinline preload="none" style="aspect-ratio:9 / 16"><source src="/media/clip.mov" type="video/quicktime"></video><figcaption class="surfdoc-video-cap">Autoplay with its controls stated</figcaption></figure>
